Hi Chris and all,
Just checking on this issue. Have you been able to develop a solution to this problem? Or have you identified a workaround?
I'm trying to prolong an MCMC chain in an R session independent of the R session on which the first MCMC iterations were run  (this way I can check the output of the first run and, if more iterations are needed, launch another R script; the whole thing is done on a cluster, so I can't keep the same R session open, as far as I know)

Thanks in advance,
Cheers,
Marwan

